# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Landapi site / bootstrap — only the publishable page goes to the remote.
#
# Tracked:  index.html      the complete single-page site (inline CSS + JS)
#           logo-mark.jpg   the cropped brand mark the page actually loads
#           .gitignore      this file
#
# Everything below is local working material: the source artwork, the working
# spec, one-off verification probes, and machine-generated cruft. The files
# stay on disk; these rules only keep them out of the published repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Working spec: requirements and internal wording, not part of the site.
/site.md

# Uncropped 2048px source artwork (it still carries a generator watermark).
# The page references only logo-mark.jpg; re-deriving it is a local step.
/logo.jpg

# One-off probes, screenshots and copied page variants used while checking
# layout in a browser. All of them are named with a leading underscore.
/_*.html
/_*/
_*.png
*.tmp

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
*.bak
*.orig
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local preview / build output, if a bundler or static server is ever added
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
.vite/
*.map
*.log

# Local configuration and credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
